    "scenesThatPass": [
      "JULIETTE: I was... away. For a very long time.\nJULIETTE: No, thanks.\nJULIETTE: It’s very good, but...\nLILI: Where were you away?",
      "JULIETTE: I’ll wait here.\nLILI: ‘Bye, Auntie!\nLILI: I noticed.\nLILI: Mummy?",
      "LILI: Auntie, look! They’re monkeys. Sometimes they spit at people.\nLILI: It’s not fair locking them up. They haven’t done anything. Prisons are for bad people, not animals? Isn’t that so, Mummy? Eh, Auntie?\nLILI: What did I do?\nJULIETTE: Don’t be silly.",
      "JULIETTE: No, look! G, G, B, B, A, B, G, G, G, B, B, A, B... Try again.\nJULIETTE: That’s better! Spread your fingers more, like that... Good. And hit the keys harder.\nLILI: It’s not easy, Auntie!\nJULIETTE: Stop! G, G, B, B, A! You have to change note.",
      "LILI: Mummy! Come and play! Play, Mummy! Auntie said you used to be very good!\nJULIETTE: A la claire fontaine m’en allant promener J’ai trouvé l’eau si claire Que je m’y suis baignée…\nJULIETTE & LEA: Il y a longtemps que je t’aime jamais je ne t’oublierai…"
    ]
  },
